OL,3,GNEWSAA63 partially closed after lorry
OL,4,Ahits bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A63 in East Yorkshire
OL,7,Fremains closed after a vehicle struck
OL,8,Fthe underside of a bridge.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the Dale Road
OL,11,Fbridge in Elloughton at about 15:00 BST
OL,12,Fon Monday.
OL,14,FNational Highways said the eastbound
OL,15,Fcarriageway, which was initially
OL,16,Fclosed, has reopened after being
OL,17,F"confirmed safe for traffic to pass
OL,18,Funderneath".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
