OL,3,GNEWSAA63 partially closed after lorry
OL,4,Ahits bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe agency said the westbound
OL,7,Fcarriageway between the A15 to Hessle
OL,8,Fand the A1034 near South Cave has been
OL,9,Fshut to enable officials to assess the
OL,10,Fdamage. It was unable to give an
OL,11,Festimated reopening time.
